  "description": {
   "en": "Royal descendant of Goguryeo, Eulbul.\n\nHe reclaims the throne from his family's enemies and is reborn as a true king!\nA hero's coming-of-age story as he drives out the long-time foes who plundered Goguryeo for 400 years and recovers the lost territory of Lelang Commandery!\nA fierce tale of life-and-death strategies and tactics unfolds...\n\nWould you like this to sound more like a game trailer or a historical drama summary?"
  },
